    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">In addition to GST e-Way Bills, packers and movers must issue IBA-approved Lorry Receipts to prove the goods transportation contract between the sender and the carrier.</p>
