    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Customs Clearance Documents:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the consignment crosses state boundaries, packers and movers must provide necessary customs clearance documents like Bill of Entry (BOE) and Invoice to ensure smooth customs clearance.</p>
